# vbm-gates release signers (an ssh allowed-signers file). A consumer copies this file to its own scripts/gates.signers, out of band, on its first install:
#   land-update --pkg gates --source witt3rd/vbm-gates --signers FILE vX.Y.Z   (fingerprint and rotation: docs/signing.md)
# Rotation: a new key is a NEW LINE here (the old line stays, so old tags still verify); consumers review the change to their own scripts/gates.signers.
vbm-gates-release namespaces="git" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMA8QfBUeDmLAEchZzDu3IKVR4LMvjLymi559Oe3R2MY
